.TH VIBEOS-VIDEO 1 "2026-11-21" "vibeos 0.1.3" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-video \- video player for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-video
.RI [ FILE | URI ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plays a video with mpv (libmpv) under an Android player's controls. A tap shows or hides the controls, which also go
by themselves 2 seconds into playing; a double tap on the left or right third skips 10 seconds back or on. The button
beside the menu puts the player full screen and takes it out again. On a screen wider than tall it opens full screen,
and turning the screen chooses again: sideways full screen, upright not. Full screen, a film shot the way the screen
is turned fills it, its edges cropped to the screen's shape; one shot the other way stays whole. Space or k plays and
pauses, Left and Right skip, f or F11 goes full screen and back, Escape closes. A file on a GVfs share (smb://, sftp://) plays through its
FUSE path, and the share is mounted first if it is not yet. Where each film was left is kept in
~/.local/state/vibeos/video/watch-later and playback resumes there.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B VIBEOS_VIDEO_LOG
mpv's log level for messages printed to the standard error (default: error).
.SH SEE ALSO
mpv(1)
